Not wired into the project on purpose (September 10, 2026).

Setting CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = ClipBuilder.entitlements on the app target
makes two builds that work today fail:

  * scripts/test.sh (Debug, CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY=-):
    "Clip Builder" has entitlements that require signing with a development
    certificate.
  * Release with automatic signing:
    No profiles for 'com.mokotti-solutions.clipbuilder' were found.

GoogleDriveKeychain already prefers the data-protection keychain and falls
back to the legacy login-keychain item when the entitlement is missing
(errSecMissingEntitlement), so wiring this file up later needs no code
change — only a signing setup that carries the entitlement (manual
Developer ID signing, verified by an actual notarized build).
